conflict in and:
  in : (and (W:p a) (N:W:p a) (W:q b))
  status: 1
  out: (and (W:p a) (W:q b))
no conflict:
  in : (and (N:W:p a) (W:q b))
  status: 0
  out: (and (N:W:p a) (W:q b))
neg_of pair is not a conflict:
  in : (and (W:p a) (W:np a))
  status: 0
  out: (and (W:p a) (W:np a))
conflict inside when effect:
  in : (and (W:q a) (when (and (W:p c) (N:W:p c)) (and (W:r a b) (N:W:r a b))))
  status: 1
  out: (and (W:q a) (when (and (W:p c) (N:W:p c)) (W:r a b)))
